  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2f78a0a3e840c3b488304b0ff928238c, type: 3}
  m_Name: AhabLoreSO
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  LoreTitle: Ahab - The Fishmonger
  LoreText:
  - "I. \u201CTo fear what you want is a terrible thing\u2026\u201D\r\n\r\nSome people
    were built for a life on the sea. At a young age, Ahab knew that his father was
    one of them and that it was his own fate to be connected to the ocean. Little
    Ahab, strolling along a beach where the water and sand met, never got close enough
    to get his feet wet, but looked out into the vast ocean in front of him, knowing
    that it stretched farther than he could ever imagine. He thought of the adventure
    that his father had experienced on the oceans\u2014the ones that he had told
    him before drifting off to sleep. As he looked out into the dark sea, the moon
    reflected upon it, he thought of pirates and sea monsters, but most of all, his
    father\u2019s encounter with a giant sperm whale. The scale of it was something
    that he couldn\u2019t comprehend.\r\n\r\nIts smooth but wrinkled skin, its giant
    eye, and the echo of its call were all things that he imagined so vividly as
    if he had seen the creature himself. When he closed his eyes at night, the creature
    took up his entire field of vision, just barely out of his grasp. "
